# Mass-consistent species for the energy-conservation check
# (validate_reverse.py in.reverse_econsv).  NO mass is set to exactly
# m(N)+m(O) so the exchange N2+O <-> NO+N conserves mass to machine
# precision and the measured thermal-energy change is limited only by the
# disposal, not by rounded molecular weights.
#
